WEBVTT

00:01:56.996 --> 00:02:00.038
And because the law
hasn't kept up with the technology,

00:02:00.079 --> 00:02:01.829
it's hurting people:

00:02:01.871 --> 00:02:03.871
Families trying to conceive,

00:02:03.871 --> 00:02:06.329
donors and surrogates trying to help them

00:02:06.371 --> 00:02:10.204
and the children born
into these wild situations.

00:02:10.246 --> 00:02:13.413
And one day it could affect
you or your loved ones.

00:02:14.371 --> 00:02:15.579
I'm an attorney,

00:02:15.579 --> 00:02:18.621
probably not surprising
by my knowledge of eggs,

00:02:18.621 --> 00:02:20.288
sperm and the law.

00:02:21.038 --> 00:02:24.371
I started my career
in the investment management group

00:02:24.413 --> 00:02:27.704
of a large international firm,
forming hedge funds.

00:02:28.038 --> 00:02:30.746
At parties, when asked
what I did for a living,